            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "क्रोध में आदमी सही और ग़लत भूल जाता है। krodh meṁ ādmī sahī aur ġalat bhūl jātā hai. In a rage a person forgets right from wrong."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "क्रोध (krodh) is a tatsama, borrowed from Sanskrit krodha, \"anger, wrath, passion\" (Monier-Williams). Everyday speech says ġussā; krodh is the word of books and sermons."
            }
          ]
        },
